{
    "title": "Wood Guy",
    "description": "Enter the world of Wood Guy, an authentic puppet fighting game where you craft your own wooden soldier and guide them through a multitude of challenges:\r\n\r\n- Arenas: Test your skills and equipment in challenging battles against formidable foes. Let your strength speak for itself as you aim for victory.\r\n\r\n- Boss Fights: Prove your might in epic battles against massive bosses. Employ strategy, control, and a touch of violence to emerge victorious and reap the rewards.\r\n\r\n- Puzzles: Exercise your intellect by navigating through intricate puzzle levels. Will your intelligence prevail over the challenges?\r\n\r\n- Wood Factory: Unlock new equipment and evolve your wooden puppet into a legendary fighter. Customize and manage your workshop to craft the ultimate warrior, ensuring no challenge can stand in your way.\r\n\r\n\r\nAre you ready to craft, fight, and conquer in Wood Guy? Download now and embark on an unforgettable adventure!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enter the world of Wood Guy, an authentic puppet fighting game where you craft your own wooden soldier and guide them through a multitude of challenges:<br><br>- Arenas: Test your skills and equipment in challenging battles against formidable foes. Let your strength speak for itself as you aim for victory.<br><br>- Boss Fights: Prove your might in epic battles against massive bosses. Employ strategy, control, and a touch of violence to emerge victorious and reap the rewards.<br><br>- Puzzles: Exercise your intellect by navigating through intricate puzzle levels. Will your intelligence prevail over the challenges?<br><br>- Wood Factory: Unlock new equipment and evolve your wooden puppet into a legendary fighter. Customize and manage your workshop to craft the ultimate warrior, ensuring no challenge can stand in your way.<br><br><br>Are you ready to craft, fight, and conquer in Wood Guy? Download now and embark on an unforgettable adventure!",
